        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-e2b3fa3e35a5",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "Transfer to Uyuni Airport for your flight to La Paz. A driver will meet you and take you to your hotel. In the afternoon, take a city tour and visit Moon Valley."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:3b5a79558b2f9897",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "3845873b99229c01224c4fe6c64af8e5629fc33baada04efc125ce8a116bf85e",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-e2b3fa3e35a5",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "Explore La Paz with an English-speaking guide on a sightseeing tour of about four hours, including the Witches' Market and historic landmarks. Afterwards, visit Moon Valley near La Paz, where erosion has shaped unusual rock formations."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:media_alt:7f8f73e73f6b4014",
